        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user summons a heavy rain that falls for five\nturns, powering up Water-type moves. It lowers\nthe power of Fire-type moves.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "５ターンの　間　雨を　降らせて\nみずタイプの　威力を　あげる。\nほのおタイプの　威力は　さがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在５回合内一直降雨，\n从而提高水属性的招式威力。\n火属性的招式威力则降低。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Genera una fuerte lluvia que refuerza los movimientos\nde tipo Agua durante cinco turnos y debilita los de tipo\nFuego.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
